adjudication.rationale:
In the newly added handler `apps/web/pages/api/webhook/app-credential.ts`, the webhook secret check is implemented as a direct inequality comparison:

```ts
if (
  req.headers[process.env.CALCOM_WEBHOOK_HEADER_NAME || "calcom-webhook-secret"] !==
  process.env.CALCOM_WEBHOOK_SECRET
) { ... }
```

This is not a constant-time comparison and can theoretically leak information via timing differences when comparing secrets, making it a security defect in the diff-grounded authentication logic for this webhook endpoint.
